  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustaining malaria elimination to achieve WHO certification by end of 2025 - Bhutan (01-Jul-2024-30-Jun-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bhutan, Malaria, Ministry of Health of the Royal Government of Bhutan (MOH)This program has the following goals: Sustaining Malaria Elimination and prevention of re-introduction. The objectives of this program are: To achieve and sustain zero indigenous malaria transmission for 3 consecutive years and achieve WHO Malaria free certification by 2025</narrative>
  </description>
